Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.60,0:00:08.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,莫妮卡呢  她在家\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14} Where's Mon?  She's at home..
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.40,0:00:11.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,布置瑞秋今晚的生日派对\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}putting up decorations for Rachel's birthday party tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.49,0:00:13.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不用帮忙吗  我有试过\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14} You're not helping?  I tried..
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.37,0:00:14.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是  显然\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}but apparently
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.52,0:00:17.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,用假音唱《我会活下去》可帮不上忙\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}singing "I Will Survive" in a helium voice,not helping.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.11,0:00:22.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  你们好  嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14} Hey,guys.  Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.08,0:00:25.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,祝你生日...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Happy birthday to...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.23,0:00:27.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别说那么大声  甘瑟会过来抱我的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Don't say that loud. Gunther's gonna want to hug me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.15,0:00:32.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好消息  我们终于找到保姆了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Good news,everyone. We finally found a nanny.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.90,0:00:33.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这位是莫莉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}This is Molly.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.71,0:00:36.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,莫莉  来见过钱德勒  乔伊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Molly,Chandler,Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.66,0:00:40.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有人有点不高兴哦\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Somebody's getting a little fussy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.33,0:00:41.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你说的没错  我就是不高兴\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You're damn right I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.63,0:00:43.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我已经等饼干等了七分钟了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I've been waiting for a cookie for seven minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.97,0:00:47.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了  我想我带她出去好了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay. You know what,I'm just gonna take her outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.78,0:00:48.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  你留下来  我去\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No,you stay. I'll do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.57,0:00:49.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好的  谢谢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.97,0:00:53.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很高兴认识你们  是啊  我们也是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14} Nice to meet you guys.  Yeah,you too.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.01,0:00:56.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哇  莫莉真的很不错  是啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14} Wow,Molly's just great.  Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.50,0:00:59.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  真棒  请了个性感保姆\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes,bravo on the hot nanny.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.88,0:01:02.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么 你真觉得她很性感吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What? You really think she's hot?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.43,0:01:03.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你开什么玩笑\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Are you kidding?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.31,0:01:06.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果我未婚  她现在就在拒绝我了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}If I wasn't married,she'd be rejecting me right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.69,0:01:09.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Joey?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.06,0:01:11.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,觉得她的姿势怎样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}How do you think she's doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.03,0:01:16.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是唯一不觉得她性感的吗  罗斯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Am I the only one that doesn't think she's hot? Ross?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.43,0:01:21.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得  她不是没有魅力  但是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I mean,she's not unattractive,but..
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.81,0:01:23.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是性感嘛\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}but hot?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.31,0:01:26.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.38,0:01:29.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瑞秋走了  说吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Now that Rachel's gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.98,0:01:32.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她真性感  我昨晚是哭着入睡的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So hot,I cried myself to sleep last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.80,0:01:36.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,《老友记》  第九季 第12集  菲比的老鼠\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Friends S09E12 The One With Phoebe's Rats
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.26,0:02:28.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  麦克  秘鲁的首都是哪里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey,Mike,what's the capital of Peru?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.56,0:02:31.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,利马  不是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14} Lima.  No.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.16,0:02:36.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是V开头X结尾的字\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It starts with a V and ends with an X.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.30,0:02:40.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然后最好中间有T和O\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And hopefully with a TO in the middle.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.71,0:02:42.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我仔细想想之后\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know,come to think of it,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.08,0:02:44.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,秘鲁的首都应该叫"VTOX"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}the capital of Peru is "Vtox."
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.44,0:02:47.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哦  天啊 怎么了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14} Oh,God!  What?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.95,0:02:50.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了  我不想要吓坏你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay. I don't want to freak you out or anything..
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.83,0:02:52.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是我刚在柜子里看到一只老鼠\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}but I just saw a rat in your cupboard.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.67,0:02:54.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哦  是哦  那是鲍伯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh,yeah. No,that's Bob.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.79,0:02:58.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是你的宠物鼠吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well,he's your pet rat?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.99,0:03:02.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不太算是  只是偶尔会来拜访\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well,not so much a pet as,you know,an occasional visitor..
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.05,0:03:05.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我有时候会喂他  有点像圣诞老人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}who I put food out for. Kind of like Santa.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.83,0:03:11.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不过圣诞老人不会在饼干盘里便便\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Except Santa doesn't poop on the plate of cookies.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.87,0:03:13.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不能在公寓里养老鼠\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You can't keep a rat in your apartment.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.85,0:03:15.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那很不卫生的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}They're extremely unsanitary.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.51,0:03:18.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,它们会传染细螺旋体病或是汉滩病毒\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I mean,they transmit leptospirosis and hantavirus.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.18,0:03:19.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么  我不知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What are those?  I don't know..
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.96,0:03:22.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但听起来可不像是温泉疗养\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}but they don't sound like spa treatments.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.51,0:03:25.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你必须处理掉他  好啦\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14} You have to get rid of it.  Okay,fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.41,0:03:27.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你这么在乎  我会处理掉鲍伯的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}If it means that much to you,I'll get rid of Bob.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.84,0:03:29.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.55,0:03:31.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真奇怪  你觉得他很恶心\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's so weird you think he's so gross,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.88,0:03:33.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,却又在吃他的饼干\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}yet you're willing to eat his crackers.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.90,0:03:45.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,加文  我想再次跟你道谢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Gavin,I just want to say thank you again..
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.84,0:03:48.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢昨天帮我照顾艾玛\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}for watching Emma yesterday during the presentation.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.01,0:03:51.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我真的需要跟你道歉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I really owe you an apology.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.81,0:03:52.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,道什么歉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}For what?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.71,0:03:54.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当我们第一次见面时  你知道的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}When we first met,you know..
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.61,0:03:58.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我以为你是自负  高傲又讨人厌的人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I thought you were pompous and arrogant and obnoxious.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.04,0:04:00.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你待会儿又得接着道歉吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Is this your first apology?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.65,0:04:02.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  我只是想说\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No,I just mean,you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.26,0:04:04.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,第一印象通常不是很重要的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}first impressions don't mean anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.31,0:04:07.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而我认为你是个好男人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And I think you're a really good guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.00,0:04:08.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很抱歉我错看了你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And I'm sorry that I misjudged you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.19,0:04:11.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,早安  嗨\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14} Morning.  Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.70,0:04:14.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想说  新的一天  新的开始\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But you know what? Hey,new day,new leaf.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.03,0:04:18.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我只是真的很高兴\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I am just really,really happy..
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.94,0:04:21.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我很抱歉  显然\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm sorry. Obviously,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.49,0:04:23.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,海瑟的屁股有更重要的事要对你说\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Heather's ass has something more important to say..
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.52,0:04:25.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我先让它说完好了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}so I'll just wait till it's finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.41,0:04:29.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么  我正在跟你道歉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14} What?  I was giving you an apology..
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.04,0:04:30.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而你一直在打量她\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}and you were totally checking her out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.87,0:04:32.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我没有  我在时装业工作\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I wasn't. I'm in fashion.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.82,0:04:34.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我只是在看她的裙子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I was looking at her skirt.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.89,0:04:37.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,貌似是裤子吧  我并没有看清楚\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Or was it pants? I didn't really see
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.11,0:04:39.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,屁股以下的部位\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}what happened below the ass area.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.43,0:04:42.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哇  你真的是  你真恶心\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wow,you are really.. You're really a creep.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.13,0:04:45.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就算我是在看她  你又在乎什么呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What do you care if I was looking at her?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.61,0:04:46.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是在忌妒吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Are you jealous?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.97,0:04:48.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哦  是啊  我好忌妒\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh,yeah. I'm jealous.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.98,0:04:52.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"哦  加文  拜托请看看我的屁股"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}"Oh,Gavin. Please,please look at my ass."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.44,0:04:55.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不要看我的屁股\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Stop looking at my ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.11,0:04:59.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我只是认为这样的行为是不妥的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I mean,I just think you are totally inappropriate. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.46,0:05:02.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是工作场所  她是你下属\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}This is a work environment. She's your subordinate.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.61,0:05:06.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但你跟你前助理泰格上床就可以吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But it was okay when you slept with your old assistant,Tag?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.28,0:05:09.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那完全不一样  原因有二\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That is totally different for two reasons.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.72,0:05:13.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一  我不知道你知道那件事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}One: I didn't know that you knew that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.46,0:05:18.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,二  我不是盯着他屁股看的恶心人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And two: I wasn't some creep staring at his ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.79,0:05:22.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们有很深入  有意义的交往\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We had a.. We had a deep,meaningful relationship.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.50,0:05:26.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,泰格姓什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What was Tag's last name?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.44,0:05:28.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It was..
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.94,0:05:31.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哦  我的天\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh,my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.98,0:05:35.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他没有  他没有 他没有姓\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}He didn't.. He didn't.. He didn't have a last name.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.68,0:05:41.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就叫泰格而已  就像雪儿  或是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It was just Tag,you know,like Cher or..
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.75,0:05:44.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,摩西\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}you know,Moses.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.66,0:05:48.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但那是很深入  有意义的交往\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But it was a deep,meaningful relationship.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.29,0:05:51.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  我对你的第一印象完全正确\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know what? My first impression of you was absolutely right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.95,0:05:53.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你高傲  又自负\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You are arrogant. You are pompous.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.62,0:05:54.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,摩根  摩根\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Morgan! Morgan!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.89,0:05:57.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,泰格姓摩根 是琼斯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14} Tag's last name was Morgan!  It was Jones.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.55,0:06:00.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是谁啊  他男朋友吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What are you,his boyfriend?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.47,0:06:04.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,（中央咖啡厅）
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.14,0:06:06.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊  我希望我有个像你一样的保姆\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Man,I wish I had a nanny like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.53,0:06:08.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是说你小时候吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You mean when you were a baby?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.09,0:06:10.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当然\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.05,0:06:15.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你可不可以别再盯着她看\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Would you stop staring at her?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.59,0:06:17.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我没有盯着\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I wasn't staring.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.56,0:06:19.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是斜眼瞄着\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I was leering.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.53,0:06:22.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她有什么了不起的呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What's the big deal with her?
