Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.26,0:12:13.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你何不自己去照镜子呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}why don't you just go look in a mirror?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.60,0:12:16.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,感谢上帝  你终于说了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Thank God you finally said that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.72,0:12:19.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,三小时前我就看到你写在笔记本上了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I saw you make a note on your pad three hours ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.50,0:12:24.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊  我真的惹你厌  是不是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Man,I really bug you. Don't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.34,0:12:25.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哦  不  拜托\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh,no. Please..
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.67,0:12:26.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我根本不在乎你  更别提讨厌你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't care about you enough to bug me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.04,0:12:29.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,事实上  从现在开始\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}In fact,from now on,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.40,0:12:31.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我会表现的很有格调\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm going to take the high road..
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.05,0:12:34.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而且我会对你非常好  妈妈的乖宝宝\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}and I'm going to be very,very nice to you,you mama's boy..
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.93,0:12:35.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,从现在开始\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}starting right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.02,0:12:39.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  瑞秋  嗨\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14} Hey,Rach.  Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.83,0:12:41.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,准备好要吃生日午餐了吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ready for your birthday lunch?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.08,0:12:42.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了  好了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I am. I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.20,0:12:45.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是首先  莫妮卡 我想要介绍你认识\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But first,Monica,I would like to introduce you..
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.23,0:12:48.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我非常能干的同事  而且更重要的是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}to my very talented colleague and more importantly..
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.75,0:12:51.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的好朋友  加文·米奇\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}my wonderful friend,Gavin Mitchell.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.27,0:12:53.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,幸会  幸会\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14} Pleased to meet you.  Pleased to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.20,0:12:54.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你会来参加瑞秋的派对吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Are you coming to Rachel's party?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.97,0:12:56.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哦  不不不不\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh,no,no,no,no.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.29,0:12:58.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,加文去不成  他已经有计划了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Gavin can't. He already has plans..
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.96,0:13:00.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,应该是要去看他妈妈\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}most likely with his mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.58,0:13:03.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不介意  我可以取消\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't mind. I'll cancel them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.34,0:13:05.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不想错过我秘书的生日\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I would never miss my secretary's birthday.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.98,0:13:10.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么你要邀请他\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Why did you invite him?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.78,0:13:12.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我无法忍受那个男的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I can't stand that guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.35,0:13:13.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你看起来跟他很好啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You were being so nice to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.86,0:13:15.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是装出来的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I was faking it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.49,0:13:17.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你难道看不出来我是装的吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Can't you tell when I'm being fake?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.06,0:13:21.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  菲利浦先生  西装真帅\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey,Mr. Phillips. Nice suit.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.01,0:13:22.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抓到了  装出来的恭维话\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Right there. That was so fake!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.10,0:13:37.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我真不敢相信  你邀请了加文\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I still can't believe you invited Gavin.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.30,0:13:40.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他是我最不想见到的人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}He is just the last person I want to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.33,0:13:41.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"不用谢我帮你办派对"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You're welcome for the party.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.62,0:13:43.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我很高兴你玩得开心\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm glad you're having a good time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.07,0:13:45.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我希望他不要出现\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I hope he doesn't show up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.71,0:13:47.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他当然不会  他讨厌我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Of course he won't,the guy hates me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.91,0:13:49.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是吗  什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14} Does he?  What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.41,0:13:53.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或许他一直惹你生气  是因为喜欢你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Maybe he keeps bothering you so much because he likes you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.61,0:13:55.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就像在小学一年级的时候\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's like in first grade
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.06,0:13:57.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,斯库普·郎把我推倒在操场上\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}when Skippy Lange would always push me on the playground
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.10,0:13:58.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,其实是因为他在暗恋我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}because he secretly had a crush on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.15,0:14:02.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,莫妮卡  你以为斯库普喜欢你吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Monica,you think Skippy liked you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.56,0:14:04.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,亲爱的  所有的男生都在打赌\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Honey,all those boys had a bet
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.27,0:14:06.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看他是不是有办法撂倒你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}to see if he could knock you over.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.86,0:14:09.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她睡了  我带她回去\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}She's out. I'm gonna take her home.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.81,0:14:10.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好的  谢谢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.13,0:14:13.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,再见  甜心\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Bye,sweetheart.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.34,0:14:18.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,男人都觉得她很有魅力  你有发现吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Do you see what all the guys see in her?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.07,0:14:21.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,至少不会想踢她下床\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wouldn't kick her out of bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.14,0:14:24.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不可以再喝伏特加了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No more vodka for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.03,0:14:26.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  瑞秋\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey,Rach.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.56,0:14:28.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在可以唱生日快乐歌了吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So can I sing "Happy Birthday" to you now?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.57,0:14:30.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当然可以 好的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14} Yeah,sure.  All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.58,0:14:32.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,祝你生日...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Happy birthday to....
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.56,0:14:35.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,待会见\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}See you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.75,0:14:38.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瑞秋  有人送你鞋子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey,Rach. Somebody got you shoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.92,0:14:39.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快给我看\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Give me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.63,0:14:46.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哇哇  我的天啊  小心小心\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14} Wow. Wow. Oh,my God!  Careful! Careful!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.30,0:14:48.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,里面是我的老鼠宝宝\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}These are my rat babies!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.37,0:14:54.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  我们现在有老鼠宝宝了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah. We have rat babies now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.76,0:15:00.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你带老鼠来参加我的生日派对\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You brought rats to my birthday party?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.35,0:15:03.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,原来中风是这种感觉啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So this is what a stroke feels like.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.35,0:15:06.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我必须要带着他们  我们杀了他们的妈\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well,I had to bring them. We killed their mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.33,0:15:08.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们现在是我们的责任了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}They're our responsibility now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.39,0:15:10.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道的  他们需要一直被照顾\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know,they require constant care.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.36,0:15:12.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你应该知道的  瑞秋  你自己也是母亲\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You should know that, Rachel, you're a mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.06,0:15:17.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你把我女儿跟一只老鼠做比较\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Are you comparing my daughter to a rat?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.30,0:15:19.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  是七只\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No. Seven rats.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.70,0:15:22.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们应该带他们回家了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We should take them home.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.03,0:15:23.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们需要吃东西了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We need to feed them.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.39,0:15:24.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你竟然要离开我的派对\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You're gonna leave my party
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.74,0:15:26.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,回去照顾一盒老鼠\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}to take care of a box of rats?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.48,0:15:27.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯  我很抱歉  瑞秋\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well,I'm sorry,Rachel,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.60,0:15:29.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是我不像你  好吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}but I'm not like you. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.24,0:15:31.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是每个人都请得起保姆的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Not everyone can afford help.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.79,0:15:41.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  乔伊跟莫莉去哪了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey,where the hell are Joey and Molly?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.36,0:15:42.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要你看住他们的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I asked you to watch them.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.57,0:15:45.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我很抱歉  我有点分心了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm sorry. I got a little preoccupied.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.23,0:15:49.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听着  我们及时阻止他们  以免出事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look,we have to stop them before something happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.60,0:15:51.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我会追随你的  大哥\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Right behind you,big guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.07,0:15:56.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以你瞧  莫莉  人们不了解\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So you see,Molly,what people don't understand..
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.57,0:15:58.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,演戏也是一门学科\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}is that acting is a discipline.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.93,0:16:00.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,需要很辛苦的学习和付出\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It takes a lot of hard work.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.65,0:16:01.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以你是在哪里学的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So where'd you study?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.06,0:16:03.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我没有上过大学\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I didn't go to college.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.59,0:16:05.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那  是从哪里学会演戏的呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No,where'd you study acting?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.57,0:16:09.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,莫莉  演戏不是学来的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Molly,people don't study acting.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.29,0:16:16.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,莫莉  可以让我们谈几分钟吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Molly,do you mind giving us just a minute?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.29,0:16:18.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当然  我去看艾玛  谢谢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14} Sure. I'll go check on Emma.  Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.49,0:16:23.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,马童就不能得到公主吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Will the stable boy never get the princess?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.26,0:16:26.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你以为你接下来会发生什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What do you think you were gonna do,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.18,0:16:28.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在我家沙发上跟她作爱\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}have sex with her right here on my couch?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.43,0:16:32.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  沙发皮会黏住我的屁股\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No. The leather sticks to my ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.27,0:16:34.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真不公平\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know, This isn't fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.48,0:16:36.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你凭什么认为我会跟她上床\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What makes you think I'm gonna sleep with her..
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.55,0:16:37.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然后就抛弃她呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}and then blow her off,huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.98,0:16:40.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们难道不能敞开心胸接受\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Can't you guys open your minds to the possibility
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.99,0:16:42.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或许我是真的喜欢她\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}that I actually like her..
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.59,0:16:44.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而且想来段真感情\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}and might want something real?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.21,0:16:47.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听着  事实上\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look,the truth is,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.43,0:16:48.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,自从瑞秋之后\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I haven't felt this way
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.80,0:16:50.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我就没有对任何人有过这种感觉了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}about anyone since Rachel.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.09,0:16:54.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吗  我以为我不会再爱了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay? I didn't think I could ever love again.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.26,0:16:56.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,少来了 乔伊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14} Come on!  Joe!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.10,0:17:05.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨  莫莉在吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hi. Is Molly here?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.64,0:17:07.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在  请进  莫莉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah,yeah. Come on in. Molly?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.84,0:17:13.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  各位  这位是塔比莎  嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14} Hey. Guys,this is Tabitha.  Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.62,0:17:18.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,明天见  好的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14} I'll see you tomorrow.  Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.36,0:17:31.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊  我觉得现在没问题了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well,Joey,I guess we have no problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.77,0:17:36.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就像是我的美梦终成真\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's like my favorite fairy tale come true.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.97,0:17:41.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,公主  马童和女同性恋\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The princess,the stable boy and the lesbian.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.81,0:17:47.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了  你先泡配方牛奶\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay. Okay,you start preparing the formula..
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.92,0:17:49.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我去换盒子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}and I'll start changing the box.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.53,0:17:51.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然后就送他们上床睡觉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And then we gotta put them straight to bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.49,0:17:55.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们什么时候变成了那种\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}When did we become one of those couples..
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.00,0:17:57.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,生活围绕着老鼠转的小情侣\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}whose lives revolve around their rats?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.66,0:18:01.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为  他们现在是我们的责任了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well,you know what? They're our responsibility now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.75,0:18:05.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  这些老鼠是我们的责任\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay,fine. These rats are our responsibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.30,0:18:07.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要是他们交配后  变成上百只呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What happens when they mate and there are hundreds?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.87,0:18:10.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,交配  他们是兄弟姐妹耶\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Mate? They're all brothers and sisters.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.17,0:18:13.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  但是对老鼠可不是问题\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah,not such a problem with rats.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.94,0:18:17.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们是"爱上谁就上谁"的那种\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No,they're more of a "love the one you're with" kind of animal.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.01,0:18:20.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,才不  真的吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No. Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.25,0:18:23.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哦  不要搞你妹妹啦\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh,my.. Get off your sister!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.39,0:18:27.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的天  我们该怎么办呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh,my God. What are we gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.09,0:18:31.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们有七只老鼠\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The.. We have seven rats.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.39,0:18:34.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果七只老鼠的每一只\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So,what if each of them has seven rats..
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.64,0:18:38.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,都再生七只  那就是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}and then each of those has seven rats? That's like..
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.24,0:18:44.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我都算不过来了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's math I can't even do!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.37,0:18:47.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们该怎么办呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What are we gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.54,0:18:50.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯  我知道这听起来很疯狂\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well,I know this is gonna sound crazy..
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.30,0:18:54.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我们可以不让这盒老鼠\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}but we could not let the box of rats
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.97,0:18:56.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,毁了我们的生活\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}ruin our lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.75,0:19:02.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  好吧  我想你说的对\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah,okay. I guess you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.49,0:19:05.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了  我们必须送走他们\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right,so we should just give them away.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.46,0:19:09.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但要送给有小孩的好人家\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But to nice families with children
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.99,0:19:11.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还要有低脂全麦饼干\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}and reducedfat Wheat Thins.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.13,0:19:14.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那些是鲍伯最喜欢的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Those were Bob's favorites.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.67,0:19:16.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,会没事的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's gonna be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.91,0:19:19.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你一定认为我疯了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You must think I'm crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.70,0:19:21.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  我觉得你很善良\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No,I think you're sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.12,0:19:25.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  真的好难\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Good. This is just so hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.65,0:19:29.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我心里好难割舍\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's hard for me to let them go.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.01,0:19:32.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我猜这让我联想起很多往事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I guess it just brings back memories,you know..
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.99,0:19:35.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就像我怀了我弟的三胞胎\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}from when I gave birth to my brother's triplets
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.70,0:19:37.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,最后却抛弃了他们\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}and I had to give them up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.90,0:19:46.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我没有告诉过你那件事吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I haven't told you about that yet,have I?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.85,0:20:00.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你帮我办派对  亲爱的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Thanks for the party,honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.92,0:20:02.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我应该帮你打扫吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Should I help you clean up?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.58,0:20:06.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不要  你的派对结束了 现在换我的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No way. You had your party. Now I have mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.69,0:20:12.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一切还好吧  我只是有点累\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14} Is everything all right?  I just get bummed..
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.55,0:20:13.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,生日结束了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}when my birthday's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.69,0:20:16.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,至少有一件事值得你高兴\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well,at least you have one thing to be happy about.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.10,0:20:20.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你办公室那个混蛋加文没有来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That jerk,Gavin,from your office didn't show up.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.30,0:20:23.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  他好讨厌哦\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah,I hate him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.14,0:20:28.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们不是在说你  我们\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We weren't talking about you. We were..
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.51,0:20:32.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  来不及掩饰了  算了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No. No way to recover. No. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.05,0:20:37.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一定很好玩  嗯  是的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14} Fun party.  Well,it was.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.65,0:20:40.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你本来会看到的  如果你不是出现在\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And you would have seen it if you didn't show up at..
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.62,0:20:46.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,九点半  天啊  派对太失败了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}9:30?! God! This party was lame.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.46,0:20:49.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,再说一次  不用客气\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Again,you're welcome!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.40,0:20:51.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听着  我把礼物给你就走人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look,I'll just give you this and go.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.00,0:20:54.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你买礼物给我  为什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You bought me a present. Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.27,0:20:58.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,让我解释一下生日派对是怎样的情况\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Let me explain how birthday parties usually work.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.20,0:20:58.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,通常有礼物\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}There are presents..
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.14,0:21:02.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有蛋糕  或许还有第四个或第五个人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}and a cake,perhaps a fourth or fifth person.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.35,0:21:06.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好的  我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay,I..
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.48,0:21:07.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我送礼物给你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I got you the present
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.47,0:21:09.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,弥补一下我对你的混蛋行为\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}to make up for being such a jerk to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.09,0:21:12.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯  好的  真好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well,okay. Well,that's very nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.17,0:21:15.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而且你还写了卡片\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And you wrote a card.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.49,0:21:18.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"加文赠"  肺腑之言\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14} "From Gavin."  I really mean it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.20,0:21:27.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真美\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.97,0:21:30.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你不介意  让我来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}If you don't mind..? Let me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.47,0:21:35.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真巧  非常合适\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well,what do you know,it fits.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.71,0:21:42.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瞧  加文  你是可以当个好男人的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}See,Gavin. You're capable of being a nice guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.32,0:21:44.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么你要刁难我呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Why do you give me such a hard time?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.65,0:21:47.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm not sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.49,0:21:49.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,莫妮卡好像认为\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well,Monica seems to think
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.39,0:21:52.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是因为你对我有感觉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}it's because you have feelings for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.63,0:21:54.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是对你有感觉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I do have feelings for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.60,0:21:57.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You do?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.70,0:22:00.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是的  我觉得你有点烦人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes. I feel that you're a little annoying.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.20,0:22:02.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么  加文  为什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}See,why? Gavin,why?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.80,0:22:04.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就在我要对你改观的时候\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Right when I'm about to change my opinion of you,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.89,0:22:06.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你就...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}you go and you..
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.18,0:22:12.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你就这样做了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And you do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.74,0:22:42.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  听着  我有东西忘了带走\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey. Listen,I think I left something here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.14,0:22:46.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是有人忘了这个  是你的吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well,somebody left this. Is this yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.31,0:22:48.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是  但是我蛮喜欢的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No,but I like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.98,0:22:52.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有一只老鼠宝宝我忘了带走\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No,I think I left one of my rat babies.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.39,0:22:57.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没  我没有看到\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well,no. I haven't seen it,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.14,0:22:58.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是如果有  我会通知你的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}but if I do,I'll let you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.61,0:23:00.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老鼠宝宝  老鼠宝宝\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Rat baby! Rat baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.71,0:23:01.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老鼠宝宝  老鼠宝宝\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Rat baby! Rat baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.33,0:23:05.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或许就是他\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Maybe that's him.
